### ============================================================================
### Kalkurasa Backend — Local HTTP Requests (Tahap 2: Auth, Settings, Master Data)
### Gunakan ekstensi REST Client (VS Code) atau salin sebagai perintah curl.
### ============================================================================

@baseUrl = http://127.0.0.1:8080
@api = {{baseUrl}}/api/v1
@demoPassword = GantiDenganSeedDemoPasswordAnda

### 0. Health Check (Publik)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/healthz
Accept: application/json

### ============================================================================
### 1. AUTENTIKASI (/api/v1/auth)
### ============================================================================

### 1.1 Login sebagai Owner (Bu Sari)
# @name loginOwner
POST {{api}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "owner@demo.test",
  "password": "{{demoPassword}}"
}

### 1.2 Login sebagai Manager (Rina)
# @name loginManager
POST {{api}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "manager@demo.test",
  "password": "{{demoPassword}}"
}

### 1.3 Login sebagai Staff / Karyawan (Budi)
# @name loginStaff
POST {{api}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "staff@demo.test",
  "password": "{{demoPassword}}"
}

### 1.4 Login sebagai Admin
# @name loginAdmin
POST {{api}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@demo.test",
  "password": "{{demoPassword}}"
}

### 1.5 Cek Profil Pengguna Saat Ini (/auth/me)
GET {{api}}/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{loginOwner.response.body.data.token}}

### 1.6 Logout
POST {{api}}/auth/logout
Authorization: Bearer {{loginOwner.response.body.data.token}}

### ============================================================================
### 2. PARAMETER USAHA (/api/v1/settings)
### ============================================================================

### 2.1 GET Settings sebagai Owner (memuat seluruh 17 kunci termasuk kas)
GET {{api}}/settings
Authorization: Bearer {{loginOwner.response.body.data.token}}

### 2.2 GET Settings sebagai Manager (tanpa opening_cash, fixed_cost_daily, cash_buffer)
GET {{api}}/settings
Authorization: Bearer {{loginManager.response.body.data.token}}

### 2.3 PUT Settings sebagai Owner (audit log tercatat otomatis)
PUT {{api}}/settings
Authorization: Bearer {{loginOwner.response.body.data.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "capacity_limit": 0.90,
  "margin_min": 0.20,
  "lead_time_days": 2,
  "dp_pct": 0.30,
  "cash_buffer": 400000
}

### ============================================================================
### 3. SUMBER DAYA & KATALOG MASTER DATA (/api/v1/resources, /products, /ingredients)
### ============================================================================

### 3.1 Daftar Sumber Daya (oven & labor beserta daily_capacity)
GET {{api}}/resources
Authorization: Bearer {{loginManager.response.body.data.token}}

### 3.2 Buat Bahan Baku Baru (Manager/Admin)
# @name createIngredient
POST {{api}}/ingredients
Authorization: Bearer {{loginManager.response.body.data.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Tepung Terigu Protein Sedang",
  "use_unit": "kg",
  "buy_unit": "sak",
  "buy_unit_size": 25,
  "buy_price": 275000,
  "stock": 3,
  "min_stock": 5,
  "rounding": "loose",
  "is_active": true
}

### 3.3 Daftar Bahan Baku sebagai Manager (memuat buy_price)
GET {{api}}/ingredients
Authorization: Bearer {{loginManager.response.body.data.token}}

### 3.4 Daftar Bahan Baku sebagai Staff (buy_price otomatis disembunyikan)
GET {{api}}/ingredients
Authorization: Bearer {{loginStaff.response.body.data.token}}

### 3.5 Buat Produk Baru (Manager/Admin)
# @name createProduct
POST {{api}}/products
Authorization: Bearer {{loginManager.response.body.data.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Snack Box Rapat",
  "category": "snack_box",
  "price": 25000,
  "packaging_cost": 2000,
  "overhead_cost": 1200,
  "is_active": true
}

### 3.6 Daftar Produk
GET {{api}}/products
Authorization: Bearer {{loginManager.response.body.data.token}}

### 3.7 Atur Resep Produk (recipe_items)
PUT {{api}}/recipes
Authorization: Bearer {{loginManager.response.body.data.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "product_id": "{{createProduct.response.body.data.id}}",
  "items": [
    {
      "ingredient_id": "{{createIngredient.response.body.data.id}}",
      "qty_per_unit": 0.12
    }
  ]
}

### 3.8 Lihat Resep Produk
GET {{api}}/recipes?product_id={{createProduct.response.body.data.id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{loginManager.response.body.data.token}}

### 3.9 Lihat Beban Produk (product_loads)
GET {{api}}/product-loads?product_id={{createProduct.response.body.data.id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{loginManager.response.body.data.token}}

### ============================================================================
### 4. MANAJEMEN PENGGUNA (/api/v1/users — Khusus Admin)
### ============================================================================

### 4.1 Daftar Pengguna (Admin)
GET {{api}}/users
Authorization: Bearer {{loginAdmin.response.body.data.token}}

### 4.2 Buat Pengguna Baru (Admin)
POST {{api}}/users
Authorization: Bearer {{loginAdmin.response.body.data.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "staf2@demo.test",
  "name": "Siti (Karyawan Dapur)",
  "role": "staff",
  "password": "{{demoPassword}}",
  "is_active": true
}

### ============================================================================
### 5. PENGUJIAN HAK AKSES (TC-09 Bagian Karyawan)
### ============================================================================

### 5.1 Karyawan mengakses proyeksi kas -> 403 Forbidden
GET {{api}}/cash/projection
Authorization: Bearer {{loginStaff.response.body.data.token}}

### ============================================================================
### 6. ALUR PESANAN INTI — TAHAP 3A (/public/* dan POST /orders)
### ============================================================================

### 6.1 Katalog Produk Aktif (Publik)
GET {{api}}/public/products
Accept: application/json

### 6.2 Cek Ketersediaan Tanggal (Publik — G1 & G4)
POST {{api}}/public/availability
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "from": "2026-11-10",
  "to": "2026-11-20",
  "items": [
    {
      "product_id": "{{createProduct.response.body.data.id}}",
      "qty": 20
    }
  ]
}

### 6.3 Buat Pesanan Publik (POST /public/orders)
# @name createPublicOrder
POST {{api}}/public/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customer_name": "Bapak Hendra",
  "customer_contact": "081234567890",
  "delivery_type": "pickup",
  "notes": "Ambil jam 09.00 pagi",
  "event_date": "2026-11-15",
  "items": [
    {
      "product_id": "{{createProduct.response.body.data.id}}",
      "qty": 20
    }
  ]
}

### 6.4 Lacak Pesanan Publik (GET /public/orders/:code — hanya field aman)
GET {{api}}/public/orders/{{createPublicOrder.response.body.data.code}}
Accept: application/json

### 6.5 Buat Pesanan Manual (Manager / Owner — mendukung negosiasi unit_price)
POST {{api}}/orders
Authorization: Bearer {{loginManager.response.body.data.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customer_name": "PT Maju Bersama",
  "customer_contact": "081122334455",
  "delivery_type": "delivery",
  "address": "Jl. Asia Afrika No. 88, Bandung",
  "event_date": "2026-11-15",
  "items": [
    {
      "product_id": "{{createProduct.response.body.data.id}}",
      "qty": 100,
      "unit_price": 21000
    }
  ]
}


